# Tauri — Rust build artifacts (large, fully reproducible)
src-tauri/target/

# Tauri updater signing keys — NEVER commit these.
# The canonical private key lives outside the repo (~/.tauri/oe-editor.key) and is
# supplied to CI via the TAURI_SIGNING_PRIVATE_KEY secret. These patterns guard
# against the realistic accident: generating or copying a key into the working
# tree and then running `git add -A`. Losing the private key means no existing
# install can ever be updated again.
*.key
*.key.pub
oe-editor.key

# Large game asset archives (local reference only, not for version control)
*.zip

# Map files (local testing only)
maps/

plans/
Core/
/CLAUDE.md
